      "catalogJson": "{\"packageRef\":{\"id\":\"content.c.p05\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\"},\"subject\":{\"id\":\"exercise.c.echo\",\"version\":\"1.1.0\",\"title\":\"输出输入变量\",\"languageRef\":{\"id\":\"lang.c\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\"},\"lessonRef\":{\"id\":\"lesson.c.variables-output\",\"version\":\"1.1.0\"},\"learningRevision\":1,\"acceptedPriorVersions\":[\"1.0.1\"],\"knowledgeRefs\":[{\"id\":\"knowledge.c.variables\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\"},{\"id\":\"knowledge.c.output\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\"}],\"programRef\":{\"id\":\"program.c.echo\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\"},\"judgeRef\":{\"id\":\"judge.c.echo\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\"},\"prompt\":\"保留输入源变量x（-999到999），用输出积木读取x，输出它的十进制整数和一个换行，不要加提示文字。例：x=7输出7并换行，x=0输出0，x=-9输出-9。必须实际声明、读取输入变量，不能打印固定答案。所有测试正常结束且main返回0。思路：先找到输入声明，再把变量读取放进printf的%d参数。\",\"tests\":[{\"caseKey\":\"positive\",\"input\":{\"x\":7},\"expectedStdout\":\"7\\n\",\"expectedExitCode\":0},{\"caseKey\":\"zero\",\"input\":{\"x\":0},\"expectedStdout\":\"0\\n\",\"expectedExitCode\":0},{\"caseKey\":\"negative\",\"input\":{\"x\":-9},\"expectedStdout\":\"-9\\n\",\"expectedExitCode\":0}],\"rewardRef\":{\"id\":\"reward.exercise.first-pass\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\"}},\"program\":{\"id\":\"program.c.echo\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"title\":\"变量输出参考\",\"languageRef\":{\"id\":\"lang.c\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\"},\"subsetRef\":{\"id\":\"subset.c.p0\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\"},\"inputRef\":{\"id\":\"input.c.scalar-x\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\"},\"exampleInput\":{\"x\":7},\"sourceExample\":\"#include <stdio.h>\\nint main(void) {\\n    int x = 7;\\n    printf(\\\"%d\\\\n\\\", x);\\n    return 0;\\n}\\n\",\"bindings\":[{\"bindingKey\":\"param.x\",\"inputKey\":\"x\",\"targetName\":\"x\",\"targetKind\":\"scalar\",\"from\":\"field\"}],\"blockRefs\":[{\"id\":\"block.c.main\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\"},{\"id\":\"block.c.integer\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\"},{\"id\":\"block.c.declare-int\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\"},{\"id\":\"block.c.read-variable\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\"},{\"id\":\"block.c.printf\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\"},